{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"5510","model":{"presentationWorkId":"egs:5510","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"山形伊左衛門","creatorId":"egs:creator:33428","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:33428","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:33428","name":"山形伊左衛門","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:204506","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_bangumi_139821","characterName":"Elfir Traum","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"139821","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"24106"},{"characterId":"139821","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"249447"},{"characterId":"139821","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"28755"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Elfir Traum","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0618"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"152"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"40"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"田舎のロブソン村で生まれ育ったが、伝染病が流行した村を救ってくれた錬金術士マルローネに憧れ、ザールブルグのアカデミーを受験する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく活発、几帳面で世話好きな頑張り屋だが、天然のドジでよく物を壊したりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の事については嫌味や当てこすりを言われてもあまり気にしない性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"甘い物には滅法目がなく、中でも大好物のチーズケーキにはひとかたならぬこだわりを持ち、効力の高いものじゃないと問答無用で捨ててしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"代わりにアルコール類は強くないらしく、「祝福のワイン」などお酒アイテムで疲労度を回復させるとたびたび酔っぱらってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみに苗字の「トラウム」とは、ドイツ語で「夢」。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「アニスのアトリエ」ではマリーと共にアカデミーが作った大図書館に収める本の執筆を恩師たちから依頼される。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アイテム図鑑のお菓子のページにはたびたび彼女の感想コメントが書かれている。甘いものが大好き。犬と猫なら犬派。マリーのガサツな面にはエリーも手を焼いているようで、「きびきびエプロン」というアイテムのコメントには「マリーさんも掃除した実証有り」と書いており、アニスも「エリー先輩が目を輝かせてマリー先輩に着せると言っていた」とまで書いたほど。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただし、エリー自身も掃除が得意と言うわけではない（システム上、『何もしなくても少しずつ部屋が汚れて行く』ように設定されている。工房を汚さないいい子はアニスだけとも言う）"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"139821"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/12/12115c5dde847350aaa5c18c0ed66a37fab949edb3c63252164fa3bfa4fae2e8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/52/52ca337a8bd301961612e25702aae81ce738ab1e8edc61525e564d7c7b46d0f6.webp","width":199,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"長沢美樹","creatorId":"vndb:s1385","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1385","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1385","name":"長沢 美樹","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:24106:139821:3913:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_59698","characterName":"ハゲル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"59698","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"11436"},{"characterId":"59698","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"19494"},{"characterId":"59698","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2250"},{"characterId":"59698","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"24106"},{"characterId":"59698","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"28755"},{"characterId":"59698","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41259"},{"characterId":"59698","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41271"},{"characterId":"59698","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41272"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ハゲル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"190"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"工作室系列中多次登场的秃头铁匠。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在不同的世界观中都很在意自己的秃头。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"--------------------------------------------------"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A19　　43歳"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"メルヴェイユで鍛冶屋を営んでいる大柄な男性。その名のとおり、頭頂部は光り輝いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"代々鍛冶屋を生業とする家系で、自らの鍛冶屋を守っていくことにかけては並々ならぬ情熱を注いでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"陽気で気の良い性格をしており、その名物っぷりは観光ガイドブックにも載るほどである。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59698"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"职业","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59698","value":"铁匠"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ee/ee4837113b5bf8050b2792d9d9974fb1b119caf50aec519e469167df306d887a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7f/7fbf71ce9d57dbf5cca0bea4b28df2233fe85c137c92674d4751caf65de0e7fe.webp","width":132,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_75304","characterName":"Eisel Weimar","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"75304","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"24106"},{"characterId":"75304","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41268"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Eisel Weimar","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"22"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0301"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"158"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"45"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"名字中的“Weimar”取自德国炼金术名城“魏玛”（Weimar）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最早登场于第二作《艾莉的工作室》，是个家境富有的千金大小姐，性格傲娇，视艾莉为竞争对手，但其实两人的关系很好，而且为人温柔大方，用国宝布做过洋娃娃送给街上的小孩子（主角：万恶的有钱人……）。暗恋着学习好又温柔的男同学诺迪斯，不过总是缺乏告白的勇气。在《薇欧蕾特的工作室》中再次登场，为了成为一流的炼金术士而在世界各地旅行修练。在旅行到卡洛迪村时，看到薇欧苦恼的样子，因此以自己的炼金术帮助薇欧渡过难关，之后还教导对炼金术产生兴趣的薇欧炼金术的基础。在听说“某个村子通过炼金术再度复兴”的传闻后，为了确认真相而再度回到卡洛迪村。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"75304"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"讨厌","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"75304","value":"很臭的东西"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/987dffd819c1e2dee1c2e1282e0bff26a0ea4a4270cf6a5b2a12989ad5c079c9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a795d7d5e547632563d543486e90c080bc954f73aae86c297f0c70f59f23a740.webp","width":181,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"飯塚雅弓","creatorId":"vndb:s1383","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1383","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1383","name":"飯塚 雅弓","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:24106:75304:3881:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_78456","characterName":"ドルニエ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"78456","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"24106"},{"characterId":"78456","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41259"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ドルニエ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"168"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"多尔尼，登场于炼金工作室系列正传A1，A2，A3以及系列外传GBAA1,肯多尼斯元老院的一员，萨尔布鲁克王立魔法学校炼金学院初代校长。,年轻时，受国王之命与莉莉来到萨尔布鲁克地区传播炼金术。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"78456"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"职业","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"78456","value":"校长"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/dd043c754b74de67481956135b5c11cf79c734f63d485e4fef0bd61318722105.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/59/591e0c11c454b7926d92c151b22408631500499a0a2494d373c58f58d6f79f90.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p910","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:766","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p910","name":"ガスト","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:5510:766","source":"egs"}],"missingStates":["confirmed-character-relation-missing","vndb-work-mapping-pending"],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
